    <briefdescription>
<para>Staged deletion policy for graduated data retirement. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>Instead of immediate hard deletion, data passes through stages:<orderedlist>
<listitem><para>Mark → flagged as expired (still readable)</para>
</listitem><listitem><para>Soft → moved to cold storage / compressed (still recoverable)</para>
</listitem><listitem><para>Hard → permanently deleted</para>
</listitem></orderedlist>
</para>
<para>Each stage is optional and has a configurable age threshold. </para>
    </detaileddescription>
